<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Results of Task 1 (context probes, Multilayer Perceptron). Numbers with <math id="A4.T4.m42" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math> give evidence that LLMs can not access the subsequent context, and numbers with <math id="A4.T4.m43" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\star" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⋆</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\star</annotation></semantics></math> show that bidirectional attention weakens preceding context utilization.</figcaption>
</figure>
